<rect x="383.8" y="88.0" width="21.3" height="18.9" rx="1.5" fill="#2f9e6e"></rect><rect x="424.8" y="88.0" width="21.3" height="48.3" rx="1.5" fill="#2f9e6e"></rect><rect x="465.8" y="88.0" width="21.3" height="19.7" rx="1.5" fill="#2f9e6e"></rect><rect x="506.8" y="73.5" width="21.3" height="14.5" rx="1.5" fill="#d64541"></rect><rect x="547.8" y="84.5" width="21.3" height="3.5" rx="1.5" fill="#d64541"></rect><text x="599.5" y="84" font-size="8" fill="#4a5666" text-anchor="middle">∅</text><rect x="629.8" y="34.4" width="21.3" height="53.6" rx="1.5" fill="#d64541"></rect><rect x="670.8" y="88.0" width="21.3" height="5.3" rx="1.5" fill="#2f9e6e"></rect><rect x="711.8" y="88.0" width="21.3" height="2.5" rx="1.5" fill="#2f9e6e"></rect><rect x="752.8" y="60.2" width="21.3" height="27.8" rx="1.5" fill="#d64541"></rect><rect x="793.8" y="88.0" width="21.3" height="44.2" rx="1.5" fill="#2f9e6e"></rect><text x="845.5" y="84" font-size="8" fill="#4a5666" text-anchor="middle">∅</text><circle cx="435.5" cy="155" r="2.6" fill="#d9a441"></circle><circle cx="476.5" cy="155" r="2.6" fill="#d9a441"></circle><text x="107.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">09-29</text><text x="189.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-08</text><text x="271.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-12</text><text x="353.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-14</text><text x="435.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-16</text><text x="517.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-20</text><text x="599.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-22</text><text x="681.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-26</text><text x="763.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-28</text><text x="845.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">10-30</text><text x="46" y="12" font-size="9" fill="#98a0ab">昨停溢价=昨日涨停池今日开盘买→收盘均收(执行口径,%);红正绿负;金点=连负≥3日(洗出反弹窗条件)</text></svg><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #4fb3aa;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(217,164,65,.06)"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#4fb3aa">❄ 冰点进攻窗 · 触发</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#98a0ab;margin-top:2px">温度&lt;25 · A档:y1+0.30%/胜率60%(n=15/12段)</div></div><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #33383f;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#5b636d">☢ 过热禁追窗 · 灭</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#5b636d;margin-top:2px">温度≥85 · A档:0/6全负·-1.86%</div></div><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #33383f;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#5b636d">♨ 洗出反弹窗 · —</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#5b636d">溢价连负3日</div></div></div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7683;margin-top:8px">读法:柱线剪刀口张开(涨停创高而金线趴地)=数量繁荣×接力冰点;三窗战绩=2025-07~2026-07单牛市周期回测,小样本,给环境判断不给指令。已证伪:复合&quot;冰点+≥2转机分量&quot;硬条件。</div></div><!--/LEADIND--></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-328db818eb36e597"></span><span id="claim-cycle-6ca103f4a58f03b0"></span><span id="claim-cycle-4ac02a0a8474a03c"></span><span id="claim-cycle-810a9e7bd24d17a1"></span><span id="claim-cycle-25d08c6812d215a6"></span><span id="claim-cycle-7395b17669801d59"></span><span id="claim-cycle-8db4311018c1b8c5"></span><span id="claim-cycle-5040b0c07eab115a"></span><span id="claim-cycle-c7f0b772480b7919"></span><span id="claim-cycle-f9d83bbbe1030585"></span><span id="claim-cycle-e85e2003efbe0a1f"></span><span id="claim-cycle-505dec9585ac781a"></span><span id="claim-cycle-d1544b886832ada3"></span><span id="claim-cycle-20a2f8a67acc1d59"></span><span id="claim-cycle-7ef50b99da686591"></span><span id="claim-cycle-77a7818202bf0318"></span><span id="claim-cycle-70ec13e0f4c2801d"></span><span id="claim-cycle-38ce57efe1a7d43a"></span><span id="claim-cycle-29ae61bec3ddd6b1"></span><span id="claim-cycle-876c31536bc40df0"></span><span id="claim-cycle-dd6da4a76c569d53"></span><span id="claim-cycle-03e162460573a5b9"></span><span id="claim-cycle-f785927b9d51276f"></span><span id="claim-cycle-e8dfb2813f87c27d"></span><span id="claim-cycle-eb83ae620eec804d"></span><span id="claim-cycle-8d1ea09659e6718b"></span><span id="claim-cycle-ab461adc9fe7c70b"></span><span id="claim-cycle-a457763f54836443"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-60913db2e6e815e9"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>三窗合计：<b>1 窗触发（核按钮）、1 窗未触发但差 1 日（溢价）、1 窗贴线未触发（晋级）</b>，加上触发器里唯一的冰点进攻窗，构成一个方向互斥的组合。我的处理原则是——触发器管「环境会不会变」，窗管「变了以后能不能做」。今日是环境有可能变好（统计 6/6 上行）、但当下做不了（执 1 全池负期望），所以主判保持退潮，攻防保持防守。</p></div></section><section id="stages"><h2>三 情绪五阶段 · 五路周期投票</h2><div id="component-MACHVOTE"><!--MACHVOTE--><!--VOTEBOARD--><div style="margin:10px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#14171e;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:10px">
