id="component-LADDER"><!--LADDER-->
<div class="card"><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">连板梯队 <span class="hint">机器核对 · 涨停池连板数分布(涨停池 47 只(zt_pool全口径,含ST))</span></h3><div class="cols"><div class="col hotc"><i style="height:4%"></i><b>1</b><span>5板</span></div>
<div class="col"><i style="height:5%"></i><b>2</b><span>3板</span></div>
<div class="col"><i style="height:15%"></i><b>6</b><span>2板</span></div>
<div class="col"><i style="height:100%"></i><b>38</b><span>1板</span></div>
</div><div class="colsub"><span>最高5板=青岛食品 休闲食品(5/5,093000首封)</span><span>腰部: 2板6只 / 3板2只 / 4板+1只</span><span>首板38占80% · 涨停池 47 只(zt_pool全口径,含ST)</span></div>
